<main>
  <p class="crumbs"><a href="/">Thulla Online</a> &rsaquo; Thulla Online FAQ</p>
  <h1>Thulla Online FAQ</h1>
  <p class="lead">Quick answers to the most common questions about Thulla Online and the Thulla card game.</p>

  <h2>Is Thulla Online free to play?</h2>
  <p>Yes. You can play Thulla in your browser for free, and the mobile app is free to download on Android and iOS.</p>

  <h2>Do I need to download anything?</h2>
  <p>No. Tap Play Instantly on the homepage and the game opens in your browser. The app is optional.</p>

  <h2>How do I play with friends?</h2>
  <p>Create a room and share the invite link on WhatsApp, Discord or any other chat app. Your friends open the link and join the same room with one tap.</p>

  <h2>How do I join a friend&#x27;s room?</h2>
  <p>Open the invite link your friend sent you. The room code is filled in automatically, so you only need to choose to join in the browser or in the app.</p>

  <h2>Is there voice chat?</h2>
  <p>Yes. Thulla Online supports voice chat so you can talk with the other players during the game.</p>

  <h2>Which devices does Thulla work on?</h2>
  <p>You can play in a modern browser on a phone, tablet or computer. There are also apps for Android and iOS.</p>

  <h2>Is Thulla the same as Bhabhi or Get Away?</h2>
  <p>They are regional names for the same family of card games. The main idea is identical, but small house rules can differ between regions.</p>

  <h2>Who goes first in Thulla?</h2>
  <p>In most versions, the player holding the Ace of Spades starts the first round. See the rules page for the full explanation of how a round works.</p>

  <h2>How do I win at Thulla?</h2>
  <p>Get rid of all your cards before the other players. The last player left holding cards is the Thulla and loses.</p>

  <h2>The game is not loading. What should I do?</h2>
  <p>Check your internet connection and reload the page. On a phone, rotate to landscape and make sure your browser is up to date. If the problem continues, try the Android or iOS app.</p>

  <p>Still learning? Read the <a href="/how-to-play">step-by-step guide</a> or the <a href="/rules">full rules</a>.</p>

